    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": "The linear fit misses the curvature entirely. The degree-5 fit tracks the\ntrue curve closely. The degree-15 fit oscillates wildly between data\npoints -- a classic sign of overfitting, where the model fits the noise\nrather than the underlying relationship.",
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": "## Comparing with the Symbolic Solution [S+N]\n\nFor the linear case (degree 1), the least-squares solution satisfies the\n**normal equations**:\n\n$$A^T A \\, \\hat{x} = A^T b$$\n\nWe can derive these symbolically in Maxima, solve them exactly, and verify\nthat the symbolic solution matches the numerical `np_lstsq` result.",
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": "/* Build the normal equations symbolically for a linear fit */\n/* Design matrix for degree 1: columns are [1, x_i] */\nV1 : vander(x, 1)$\ny1 : np_reshape(y, [n, 1])$\n\n/* Normal equations: (V^T V) c = V^T y */\nVtV : np_matmul(np_transpose(V1), V1)$\nVty : np_matmul(np_transpose(V1), y1)$\n\nprint(\"V^T V (2x2):\")$\nnp_to_matrix(VtV);\nprint(\"V^T y (2x1):\")$\nnp_to_matrix(Vty);",
      "metadata": {},
      "execution_count": 12,
      "outputs": [
        {
          "name": "stdout",
          "output_type": "stream",
          "text": [
            "V^T V (2x2):\nmatrix([20.0,50.0],[50.0,171.05263157894737])\nV^T y (2x1):"
          ]
        },
        {
          "data": {
            "text/latex": [
              "\\ifx\\endpmatrix\\undefined\\pmatrix{\\else\\begin{pmatrix}\\fi 5.0137846236765995 \\cr 36.327904791490695\\cr \\ifx\\endpmatrix\\undefined}\\else\\end{pmatrix}\\fi "
            ]
          },
          "execution_count": 12,
          "metadata": {},
          "output_type": "execute_result"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": "/* Solve the normal equations numerically */\ncoeffs_normal : np_solve(VtV, Vty)$\n\n/* Compare with np_lstsq */\n[coeffs_lstsq, res1, rank1, sv1] : np_lstsq(V1, y1)$\n\nprint(\"Normal equations solution:\", np_to_list(coeffs_normal))$\nprint(\"np_lstsq solution:        \", np_to_list(coeffs_lstsq))$\n\ndiff_norm : np_norm(np_sub(coeffs_normal, coeffs_lstsq))$\nprint(\"Difference norm:\", diff_norm)$",
      "metadata": {},
      "execution_count": 13,
      "outputs": [
        {
          "name": "stdout",
          "output_type": "stream",
          "text": [
